    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        713,
        1261,
        759
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City of New York must make every effort to insure the economic and\nefficient operation of all City agencies; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2422,
          "min": -1.1496
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 28,
          "mean": -0.0212,
          "min": -0.5841
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6220,
        "area_px": 43569,
        "density": 0.14276,
        "chars": 125,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        758,
        1261,
        803
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is the clear policy of this administration to operate its Mayoral agencies\nstrictly within budgeted revenues; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2008,
          "min": -1.1425
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0189,
          "min": -0.4794
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6162,
        "area_px": 42642,
        "density": 0.14451,
        "chars": 125,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        803,
        1261,
        848
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary that the non-Mayoral agencies function within the allotments\nof tax levy funds that are currently available.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1754,
          "min": -0.9126
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0062,
          "min": -0.1513
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6630,
        "area_px": 42642,
        "density": 0.15548,
        "chars": 133,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.06
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        848,
        1261,
        892
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, Therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is\nhereby ordered:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1809,
          "min": -1.0872
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0013
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0021,
          "min": -0.0511
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4759,
        "area_px": 41715,
        "density": 0.11408,
        "chars": 97,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.38
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        897,
        1261,
        967
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. The Director of the Office of Management and Budget is hereby ordered\nto take all necessary steps to closely monitor expenditures of all agencies to insure that ex-\npenses remain strictly within available revenues.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1652,
          "min": -0.9961
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.1431,
          "min": -0.1431
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 43,
          "mean": -0.0069,
          "min": -0.1642
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10238,
        "area_px": 65817,
        "density": 0.15555,
        "chars": 225,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.98
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        968,
        1261,
        1034
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. The non-Mayoral agencies, such as the Health and Hospitals Corporation, Board of Education and Board of Higher Education are hereby notified that their allotments represent the maximum tax levy funds that are available within the current 1975-76 budget.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1572,
          "min": -0.9815
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 55,
          "mean": -0.0055,
          "min": -0.1624
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12424,
        "area_px": 63036,
        "density": 0.19709,
        "chars": 258,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.77
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        1038,
        1261,
        1083
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. All City agencies must remain within their current allotments and not permit the\ncreation of future deficits by any action during the 1975-76 fiscal year.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1455,
          "min": -1.0004
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.005,
          "min": -0.1649
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7015,
        "area_px": 42642,
        "density": 0.16451,
        "chars": 159,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.67
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        340,
        1088,
        1261,
        1155
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 4. All City agencies are hereby notified that they must immediately review their\npayrolls and make any necessary adjustments to insure that they will operate within their\nbudgetary allocations in the 1975-76 fiscal year.",
      "logprob_stats": {
